WEBVTT

00:00:08.755 --> 00:00:09.995
-(CRUNCHING)
-(GASPS)

00:00:11.035 --> 00:00:13.995
Bullseye. Bullseye, go, go, go, go.

00:00:14.755 --> 00:00:16.555
Come on. You don't wanna
help me. I'm the bad guy.

00:00:16.635 --> 00:00:20.235
You're gonna go back in storage
because of me, remember? Just go.

00:00:20.315 --> 00:00:23.355
Bullseye... (SPUTTERING)
All right. All right.

00:00:23.435 --> 00:00:27.075
But you have got
to keep quiet. Come on.

00:00:33.835 --> 00:00:36.555
Over here. Attaboy.

00:00:36.635 --> 00:00:38.755
Okay, Bullseye. Upsy-daisy.

00:00:38.835 --> 00:00:40.035
(CONTINUES SNORING)

00:00:47.395 --> 00:00:48.795
(MUFFLED GRUNTING)

00:00:51.075 --> 00:00:52.075
(CHUCKLING)

00:00:53.995 --> 00:00:55.835
Psst. Bullseye. Cut it out.

00:00:55.915 --> 00:00:58.475
Stop it. Psst.
Stop it, Bullseye. Stop it. Stop it.

00:00:58.955 --> 00:01:00.235
Stop it.

00:01:07.555 --> 00:01:08.595
(STOMACH RUMBLING)

00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:14.755
-(BURPING)
-(GROANING)

00:01:14.835 --> 00:01:16.555
(GAGGING)

00:01:17.675 --> 00:01:18.675
(EXHALING)

00:01:24.755 --> 00:01:25.995
(SNORTING)

00:01:27.635 --> 00:01:30.075
-Phew.
-(REMOTE CLICKS)

00:01:30.155 --> 00:01:33.195
♪ Woody's Roundup
Come on, it's time to play ♪

00:01:33.275 --> 00:01:34.715
(GASPING)

00:01:34.875 --> 00:01:37.875
No, Officer! I swear.
(MUTTERING) What? (GASPS)

00:01:38.315 --> 00:01:40.955
(GASPING, MUTTERING)

00:01:44.275 --> 00:01:45.515
Uh... Oh.

00:01:46.275 --> 00:01:49.315
Get in there.
There you go. Cheap case.

00:01:49.395 --> 00:01:51.875
-Where is the remote?
-(THEME SONG CONTINUES)

00:01:51.955 --> 00:01:54.155
Where is the remote?

00:01:54.235 --> 00:01:55.315
(GRUNTING)

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:59.075
Why don't I put it in the same place
every... Oh, here it is.

00:02:00.715 --> 00:02:01.755
(YAWNING)

00:02:01.915 --> 00:02:02.915
(MUTTERING)

00:02:07.195 --> 00:02:08.195
(DOOR CLOSING)

00:02:10.115 --> 00:02:12.995
What is your problem? Look, I'm sorry
I can't help you guys out.

00:02:13.075 --> 00:02:15.795
Really, I am. But you didn't have
to go and pull a stunt like that.

00:02:16.155 --> 00:02:17.955
What? You think I did that?

00:02:18.075 --> 00:02:20.475
Oh, right, right.
The TV just happened to turn on,

00:02:20.555 --> 00:02:22.955
and the remote magically ended up
in front of you!

00:02:23.035 --> 00:02:26.035
-You calling me a liar?
-Well, if the boot fits...

00:02:26.315 --> 00:02:28.155
Say that again.

00:02:28.555 --> 00:02:31.555
(ENUNCIATING) If the boot fits.

00:02:31.915 --> 00:02:34.235
Okay, cowboy.

00:02:37.675 --> 00:02:39.515
-Yah!
-(GRUNTING)

00:02:39.635 --> 00:02:43.715
How do you like that?
Take it back! Take it back!

00:02:43.795 --> 00:02:46.195
Don't think just 'cause you're a girl,
I'm gonna take it easy on you.

00:02:46.275 --> 00:02:48.715
-(SCREAMS)
-Jessie, Woody, you stop this at once.

00:02:48.795 --> 00:02:50.595
-(CRIES OUT)
-(GASPS)

00:02:51.875 --> 00:02:54.635
I don't know
how that television turned on,

00:02:54.715 --> 00:02:56.835
but fighting about it
isn't helping anything.

00:02:56.915 --> 00:03:00.315
-If I had both my arms...
-The fact is, you don't, Woody,

00:03:00.395 --> 00:03:02.715
so I suggest
you just wait until morning.

00:03:02.795 --> 00:03:05.995
-The cleaner will come, fix your arm...
-And then I'm outta here!

00:03:08.235 --> 00:03:11.515
Oh, no, no.
Bullseye, don't take it that way.

00:03:11.595 --> 00:03:14.195
-It's just that Andy...
-Andy, Andy, Andy.

00:03:14.275 --> 00:03:16.795
That's all he ever talks about.

00:03:20.835 --> 00:03:21.835
(SIGHS)

00:03:26.475 --> 00:03:28.395
Hey, Buzz, can we slow down?

00:03:28.475 --> 00:03:32.315
May I remind you that some of us are
carrying over $6 in change?

00:03:32.435 --> 00:03:35.395
Losing health units. Must rest.

00:03:35.475 --> 00:03:37.195
Is everyone present and accounted for?

00:03:37.315 --> 00:03:38.635
Not quite everyone.

00:03:38.715 --> 00:03:40.235
-Who's behind?
-Mine.

00:03:45.475 --> 00:03:49.035
Hey, guys.
Why do the toys cross the road?

00:03:49.115 --> 00:03:52.035
-Not now, Hamm.
-Oh, I love riddles. Why?

00:03:52.115 --> 00:03:56.395
To get to the chicken
on the other side! (LAUGHS)

00:03:56.475 --> 00:03:58.875
-(ALL WHOOPING)
-REX: The chicken!

00:04:03.715 --> 00:04:06.155
-Oh, well. We tried.
-We'll have to cross.

00:04:06.235 --> 00:04:07.235
-(ALL GASPING)
-What the...

00:04:07.315 --> 00:04:09.115
You're not turning me
into a mashed potato.

00:04:09.195 --> 00:04:13.595
I may not be a smart dog,
but I know what roadkill is.

00:04:14.075 --> 00:04:15.755
There must be a safe way.

00:04:19.835 --> 00:04:22.795
BUZZ: Okay.
Here's our chance. Ready. Set. Go.

00:04:27.115 --> 00:04:28.275
(WHIMPERING)

00:04:33.515 --> 00:04:34.715
Drop!

00:04:37.355 --> 00:04:39.675
-(AIR HISSING)
-(HORNS HONKING)

00:04:39.995 --> 00:04:41.155
BUZZ: Go!

00:04:43.595 --> 00:04:46.155
BUZZ: Drop! I said "drop"!

00:04:46.235 --> 00:04:48.475
(HORNS HONKING)

00:04:48.555 --> 00:04:49.715
BUZZ: Go!

00:04:52.035 --> 00:04:53.115
(MUMBLING)

00:04:57.395 --> 00:04:58.715
BUZZ: Drop.

00:05:00.715 --> 00:05:02.555
(HORN HONKING, TIRES SQUEALING)

00:05:07.035 --> 00:05:08.195
BUZZ: Go.

00:05:33.155 --> 00:05:34.155
That went well.

00:05:35.435 --> 00:05:36.595
(HORNS HONKING)

00:05:41.715 --> 00:05:44.995
Good job, troops.
We're that much closer to Woody.

00:05:45.115 --> 00:05:46.355
(HONKING CONTINUES)

00:05:47.435 --> 00:05:48.555
(RINGING)

00:05:48.915 --> 00:05:50.835
Oh, thank goodness you're here.

00:05:50.955 --> 00:05:53.595
Is the specimen ready for cleaning?

